        "governing_subject_operation_default_unit_type_domain_exceptions": "Model has Objects, Events, Agents and Rights. Fixity digest comparison records an Event and eventOutcome. Equal same-algorithm digests are evidence of unchanged content; fixity is distinguished from structural/format integrity and authenticity. File/Bitstream fixity fields do not establish authorship or restore success.",
        "applicability_assessment": "Supports lightweight event-log analogy and logical/fixity/custody distinction, not CSV PREMIS conformance or a deployed system."
